    "code_released": "https://github.com/AtlasAnalyticsLab/MonoLoss",
    "peer_reviewed": "preprint",
    "problems": "The reported class-purity improvements are induced by a loss designed to produce semantically consistent activations and therefore do not establish that ordinary model representations exhibit superposition. Class purity inherits ImageNet label bias, as the authors note. No uncertainty estimates are stated for the reported purity values.",
    "rows_left_out": "Qualitative activation examples across Figures 3, 5–25, and 29–40, and plotted MonoScore profiles and comparisons in Figures 4 and 26–28, are not separately tabulated as rows here; the text does not provide separately extractable numerical values for each condition.",
    "untested": [
